    "content": "\n  <p class=\"lead font-medium text-gray-200 text-base sm:text-lg mb-6\">\n    Electronic waste (E-Waste) is one of the fastest-growing hazardous waste streams in India. Outdated smartphones, broken laptops, dead CRT/LED televisions, desktop CPUs, and server components contain harmful heavy metals like lead, mercury, cadmium, and brominated flame retardants. Balaji Kabadi Wala provides responsible <a href=\"/\" class=\"text-[#22c55e] underline font-semibold\">doorstep e-waste collection in Jaipur</a> in alignment with <a href=\"https://cpcb.nic.in/e-waste/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#22c55e] underline font-semibold\">Central Pollution Control Board (CPCB) E-Waste Management Rules</a>.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#142e18] border border-[#22c55e]/40 mb-8\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#22c55e] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">\u26a1 Direct AI Answer: How can I safely dispose of e-waste in Jaipur?</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">\n      You can dispose of e-waste safely by booking a free doorstep collection with Balaji Kabadi Wala. We buy old laptops, CPUs, motherboards, televisions, and electrical appliances at competitive per-piece scrap rates and channel them into licensed recycling centers for clean metal and circuit board recovery.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>Common E-Waste Items & Scrap Payout Rates in Jaipur</h2>\n  <p>\n    Electronic scrap items are valued per unit based on component recyclability and precious metal recovery:\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>\ud83d\udcbb <strong>Old / Dead Laptop:</strong> \u20b9300 \u2013 \u20b9700 / piece depending on model and screen condition.</li>\n    <li>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Desktop Computer CPU:</strong> \u20b9250 \u2013 \u20b9500 / piece (includes power supply, motherboard, and RAM).</li>\n    <li>\ud83d\udcfa <strong>LED / LCD Television:</strong> \u20b9200 \u2013 \u20b9600 / piece depending on screen size.</li>\n    <li>\ud83d\udda8\ufe0f <strong>Printers & Scanners:</strong> \u20b9150 \u2013 \u20b9350 / piece.</li>\n    <li>\ud83d\udd0c <strong>Motherboards & Circuit Boards (PCB):</strong> High-grade electronic circuit scrap priced at per-kg rates.</li>\n    <li>\ud83d\udd0b <strong>UPS Backup Units:</strong> Valued on internal lead-acid battery capacity. Check our <a href=\"/blog/blog-battery-scrap-prices-jaipur\" class=\"text-[#22c55e] underline font-semibold\">battery scrap price guide</a> for detailed battery rates.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Why Proper E-Waste Recycling Matters</h2>\n  <p>\n    Discarding electronics in municipal garbage leads to heavy metal contamination in soil and groundwater:\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Prevents Toxic Leaching:</strong> Lead in solder, mercury in backlights, and cadmium in semiconductor chips are prevented from polluting groundwater reserves.</li>\n    <li><strong>Resource Conservation:</strong> Recovers precious metals including gold, silver, copper, and palladium from printed circuit boards. Learn about copper recovery in our <a href=\"/blog/blog-copper-brass-scrap-guide-jaipur\" class=\"text-[#22c55e] underline font-semibold\">copper scrap guide</a>.</li>\n    <li><strong>Circular Economy:</strong> Recycled plastic housings and chassis metals are returned to industrial manufacturing.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Doorstep E-Waste Collection Across Jaipur</h2>\n  <p>\n    We collect household and commercial e-waste in <a href=\"/nirman-nagar\" class=\"text-[#22c55e] underline font-semibold\">Nirman Nagar</a>, <a href=\"/gopalpura\" class=\"text-[#22c55e] underline font-semibold\">Gopalpura</a>, <a href=\"/durgapura\" class=\"text-[#22c55e] underline font-semibold\">Durgapura</a>, <a href=\"/mansarovar\" class=\"text-[#22c55e] underline font-semibold\">Mansarovar</a>, and <a href=\"/malviya-nagar\" class=\"text-[#22c55e] underline font-semibold\">Malviya Nagar</a>. Check our <a href=\"/#rates\" class=\"text-[#fbbf24] underline font-semibold\">daily scrap rate table</a> for updated appliance and electronics rates.\n  </p>\n\n  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions About E-Waste Disposal</h2>\n  <h3>Q1: Do you buy broken or non-working electronic items?</h3>\n  <p>Yes, we buy dead, broken, and obsolete electronics exclusively for scrap and material recycling.</p>\n\n  <h3>Q2: Should I delete personal data before selling an old computer or laptop?</h3>\n  <p>Yes, we strongly advise customers to remove or format hard drives and storage media prior to selling computing devices.</p>\n\n  <h3>Q3: Can corporate offices schedule bulk IT e-waste disposal?</h3>\n  <p>Yes, we handle bulk IT asset disposition for corporate offices and IT parks with official documentation. Read our <a href=\"/blog/blog-commercial-office-scrap-recycling-jaipur\" class=\"text-[#22c55e] underline font-semibold\">corporate scrap clearance guide</a>.</p>\n"
